            <ArticleTitle>Two new labdane-type diterpenoids cinnamate from Croton decalvatus Esser.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>1-8</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1080/14786419.2017.1408089</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Two new labdane diterpene derivatives, crotondecalvatin A (1) and crotondecalvatin B (2) were obtained from the leaves and twigs of Croton decalvatus. The structures of compounds were established on the basis of extensive spectroscopic data.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
